 {r}←rep Remove_githubUsername_ folder;filename;list;ns
 r←0
 filename←folder,'/cider.config'
 :If F.IsFile filename
     ns←ReadProjectConfig filename
     :If 0<ns.CIDER.⎕NC'githubUsername'
         ns.CIDER.⎕EX'githubUsername'
         {}ns WriteProjectConfig filename
         rep.report,←⊂filename
     :EndIf
 :EndIf
 list←F.ListDirs2 folder
 :If 0<≢list
     {}rep Remove_githubUsername_¨list      ⍝ Itself, not `RenameInfo_url_`, and `rep` collects the report
 :EndIf
⍝Done
